Z||000000||Springtyme||09-04-2001||09:54 AM||||Well it took me a while to get some pictures, but I did it. =) Enough with chit chat, on with the pics!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3.JPG"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/4_7.jpg"> <P>The black Fiero next to mine is Eric's. Thats the one he's putting the 3800 rebuild into.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/5_6.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/6_5.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/7_3.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/8_1.jpg"> <P>Freshly washed, waiting to dry in the sun. I had just washed it 2 days ago, but then I followed behind some Fiero with a leaking tranny hose. Needless to say, my car was coated in red flecks and I could barely see out my windshield... *cough*eric*cough*<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> <P>            ~Springtyme~||||reg||10
Z||000001||Springtyme||09-04-2001||09:55 AM||||-CONTINUED-<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interior_3.JPG"> <P>Thats the spotless interior, I was driving when it was taken, but you can see it's in pretty darn good shape.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/me3.JPG"> <P>I laugh every time I see this picture... I think it's hilarious how my car only reaches to the handle on the truck. =) Hehehe, and yes, that's me in front. Sorry the post is so long!!!!||||reg||10
